# Lecture Hall: "Other permanents you control have hexproof" (CR 702.11, layer 6), a static ability of a door that applies
# while the door is unlocked (CR 709.5). Bot1 casts Lecture Hall beside Memnite and Mox Pearl: Memnite and the Mox have
# hexproof, the Room itself does not ("other"), and Bot2's Memnite does not ("you control"). Bot2 can't target Bot1's
# Memnite with Lightning Bolt (CR 702.11b) and bolts Bot1 instead; Bot1's own Giant Growth still targets Memnite (hexproof
# stops only opponents).

